    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About the Jaeger panels",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Grafana Alloy exports **every span to both Tempo and Jaeger**, so the same trace ID opens in either.\n\n**Search** traces in the [Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686/search?service=mytoolkit): Jaeger 2.23 serves only its `api_v3` query API, and Grafana's Jaeger data source still uses the removed legacy API for search (pending [jaeger#7594](https://github.com/jaegertracing/jaeger/issues/7594)). Opening a trace **by ID** works in Grafana (`jaegerEnableGrpcEndpoint` feature toggle, set in docker-compose.yml)."
      },
      "id": 18,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 68
      }
